{"Email normalization is incomplete: blacklist comparison uses toLowerCase() on env values but compares against raw guest string, and existing attendee check is case-sensitive allowing duplicate entries with different casing": 0.9713857769966125, "Authorization logic uses AND (&&) instead of OR (||), requiring a user to be both a team admin AND team owner simultaneously, incorrectly denying access to legitimate team admins who are not owners": 0.9708288908004761, "Validation schema is duplicated in client with uniqueness check but server-side schema lacks this uniqueness validation, creating inconsistency where server may accept duplicate emails if client validation is bypassed": 0.886688232421875, "Using createMany without transaction protection creates a race condition risk where concurrent requests adding the same guest can fail mid-operation, leaving database and calendar/email state inconsistent": 0.6824935674667358, "Email errors are silently swallowed with a generic console.log, losing the actual error object, stack trace, and context like bookingId/userId, making production debugging difficult": 0.9793397188186646, "getUsersCredentials(ctx.user) retrieves credentials for the logged-in user instead of the booking organizer, causing calendar updates to fail or update the wrong calendar when a non-organizer invokes the mutation": 0.9759538173675537}